---
import SiteLayout from '../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
const href = (value: string) => `${base.replace(/\/?$/, '/')}${value.replace(/^\/+/, '')}`;
const flow = 'Benchmark assets: Package / Case / RunVariant\n' +
  '                  │\n' +
  '                  ▼\n' +
  'Evaluation Engine: validate → resolve → preview → freeze\n' +
  '                  │\n' +
  '                  ▼\n' +
  'Immutable EvaluationTask → ExecutionAttempt(s)\n' +
  '                  │\n' +
  '                  ▼\n' +
  'Evidence → validity check → EvaluationResult\n' +
  '                  │\n' +
  '                  ▼\n' +
  'Reporting / aggregation / regression analysis';
---
<SiteLayout title="Sandbox Benchmark 架构" lang="zh" wide={true} description="Sandbox Benchmark 的评估流程、阅读路径和可靠性评估范围。">
  <section class="home-hero">
    <span class="eyebrow">Sandbox / Evaluation</span>
    <h1>Benchmark 架构与评估边界</h1>
    <p>Benchmark 用于明确要验证的主张、运行可追溯的实验，并依据有效证据形成结果。本页只提供评估体系的整体地图和阅读入口；Case 语义、任务冻结和结果判定分别由对应 owner 文档定义。</p>
    <div class="home-actions">
      <a href={href('/components/sandbox/#benchmark-framework')}>评估框架与被测对象边界 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      <a href={href('/components/ca-benchmarks/#benchmark-assets')}>Benchmark 资产与 Case <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      <a href={href('/components/ca-benchmark-engine/#evaluation-lifecycle')}>执行生命周期与结果语义 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="home-section">
    <h2>一次评估的基本流程</h2>
    <pre><code>{flow}</code></pre>
    <p>Freeze 固定本次评估的输入与解析后的绑定；它本身不代表执行已经开始，也不保证本次实验有效或通过。</p>
  </section>

  <section class="home-section">
    <h2>三个问题，三份权威定义</h2>
    <div class="reading-list">
      <a class="reading-item" href={href('/components/sandbox/#benchmark-framework')}>
        <span class="reading-number">01</span>
        <span><strong>我们想证明什么？</strong><small>评估主张、Component Under Test（CUT）、测试方向和适用模式由 Sandbox 层评估框架说明。</small></span>
        <span class="reading-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
      </a>
      <a class="reading-item" href={href('/components/ca-benchmarks/#benchmark-assets')}>
        <span class="reading-number">02</span>
        <span><strong>具体评估什么？</strong><small>Benchmark 资产仓定义 Package、Case、RunVariant、预期语义和 Case 所需证据。当前首批 13 个 Case 的详细状态以源仓为准。</small></span>
        <span class="reading-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
      </a>
      <a class="reading-item" href={href('/components/ca-benchmark-engine/#evaluation-lifecycle')}>
        <span class="reading-number">03</span>
        <span><strong>怎样执行并判定？</strong><small>Engine 定义解析与冻结、ExecutionAttempt、证据有效性、EvaluationResult 和结果报告的边界。</small></span>
        <span class="reading-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="home-section">
    <h2>当前关注：可靠性</h2>
    <p>当前优先关注约束遵循、权威结果核验、未知结果处理、安全恢复，以及证据有效性。这里列出的是评估方向，不是完整用例清单，也不表示每个 Case、Mode 或 Environment realization 都已通过实时验收。</p>
    <p><a href={href('/components/sandbox/#benchmark-framework')}>查看源仓维护的测试方向与评估边界 →</a></p>
  </section>

  <section class="home-section">
    <h2>结果不能只看一个 PASS / FAIL</h2>
    <p>评估报告必须区分被测系统的行为、环境权威状态、证据是否足以支持判定，以及最终 Benchmark Verdict。环境或评测基础设施不满足前提时，不能自动将其归为被测系统失败；具体规则以 Engine 和 Case 契约为准。</p>
    <p><a href={href('/runbooks/real-5gc/')}>查看真实 5GC 的运行与验收证据 →</a></p>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>
